~ knife
set GlobalState.player_can_move = false
There's a {{item_name}} on the table. Pick it up?
- Pick up
	set GlobalState.mark_item_collected(item_name)
	set GlobalState.set_room_state("LevelBedroom", "blackout", true)
	Picked up {{item_name}}!
- Leave
set GlobalState.player_can_move = true
=> END

~ letter
set GlobalState.player_can_move = false
There's a {{item_name}} on the ground. Pick it up?
- Pick up
	set GlobalState.mark_item_collected(item_name)
	
	[speed=0.4]You will never wake... up...
	You will ne░▒▓ver wake up!
	YOU WILL [color=#ff0000][shake rate=18 level=4]NEV█ER[/shake][/color] W△KE UP!!!

- Leave
set GlobalState.player_can_move = true
=> END